title: mfr_duplicate_group
tags: [[Reserved field]] [[Duplicate groups]]
kind: reference
summary: On a file: the duplicate group it belongs to.

A `ref` to the group's metarecord; present only while the file exists and had an
identical twin at the last scan ([[Duplicate groups]]). Listing what else is identical
to a file is `same(mfr_duplicate_group, <uuid>)` ([[Finding duplicates]]).
